sequenceDiagram
    actor T as Technician
    actor O as Service Officer
    participant App as CampusServiceApp
    participant M as ServiceRequestManager
    participant SR as ServiceRequest (e.g. ICTSupportRequest)
    T->>App: "11. Technician Menu" → "Resolve request" (TECH001, REQ001, comment)
    App->>M: resolveRequest("REQ001", "TECH001", comment)
    M->>SR: resolve(technician, comment)
    SR->>SR: is technician the assigned Technician?
    SR->>SR: private checkTransition(Resolved) — is status In Progress?
    alt not allowed
        SR-->>App: throws "Only the assigned Technician can resolve this request." / "Invalid status change"
        App-->>T: Error message
    else allowed
        SR->>SR: private changeStatus(Resolved) → add history entry
        SR-->>App: request
        App-->>T: "Done. REQ001 is now Resolved."
    end
    O->>App: "10. Service Officer Menu" → "Verify and close" (OFF001, REQ001, comment)
    App->>M: closeRequest("REQ001", "OFF001", comment)
    M->>SR: close(officer, comment)
    SR->>SR: officer instanceof ServiceOfficer?
    SR->>SR: private checkTransition(Closed) — is status Resolved?
    alt not allowed
        SR-->>App: throws "Only a Service Officer can close requests." / "Invalid status change"
        App-->>O: Error message
    else allowed
        SR->>SR: private changeStatus(Closed) → add history entry
        SR-->>App: request
        App-->>O: "Done. REQ001 is now Closed."
    end
